'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a set of [[heavy armor]] in ''[[Helldivers 2]]''.

== Acquisition ==
Both the [[body armor]] and [[helmet]] can be claimed from page two of the [[Borderline Justice Premium Warbond#Page 2|Borderline Justice]] Premium [[Warbond]] for {{Currency|Medals|55|notext}} and 45 [[Medal]]s, respectively.

